Introduction

The following information reviews the new features and bug fixes for
the 3.2.1 release of the DSP1600 SGS (Software Generation System) Tools.
This document covers only the DSP1600  Family SGS Tools which are
generic to the DSP1600 family of processors.  Information concerning
device specific tools is contained in the appropriate DSP16XX-ST
release note.

                                   
